XCLAW-84 fix. Two critical bugs in connector→agent flow: (1) router.rs called send_message() instead of send_user_message() — messages didn't have processed=0 so processor's has_unprocessed() returned false. (2) Conversation processor never spawned after message injection. HTTP route does it but connector event loop didn't. Fix: route_event() returns Option<(conv_id, agent_id)>, server event loop spawns ProcessorContext with full state when Some.
